  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "公司及票據法",
    "sub_ename": "COMPANY ACT & NEGOTIABLE INSTRUMENTS ACT",
    "describe_ch": "在商業高度發展的現代社會，對商事法知識及學養之要求，日益受到各界重視，尤其商學院之學生更應對企業經營之組織及商業交易行為之支付工具有基本的認識，而本科目之教學目標即是在於提供學生這方面學識專長的養成。本課程將介紹並探討商業活動中相關之公司法及票據法的規範，使學生熟悉並能運用法律規範於商業實務。",
    "describe_eh": " In today's highly developed commercial society, it is essential to everyone to get acquaintance with commercial law and related regulation, as it becomes important in our modern business environment.  Especially, for those students whose majors are in business, they should equip themselves with the fundamental corporate law and payment system.  Accordingly, this course is designed to provide students needed training and to enable them to have a basic understanding of corporate law and payment system.  After the course of study, students will be able to identify corporate and payment system related issues and apply relevant laws and regulation correctly.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
