      "describe_ch": "學生能描述現代商業組織與公司、票據之特色",
      "describe_en": "Students would be able to describe the characteristics of modern business organizations, payment systems and companies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "針對傳統與現代商業組織，學生能說明商業組織與法律之相互關係，並能清楚表達",
      "describe_en": "Students would be able to express clearly and to illustrate the correlations of modern business organizations, payment systems and related laws."
    }
